    {
      "bbox": [
        165,
        711,
        1640,
        921
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "WHEREAS it is our responsibility to make certain that continued usefulness to society and status in the community shall not be terminated by reason of age, alone; nor shall false concepts concerning aging result in discriminatory practices, social isolation or segregation of elderly men and women, and",
