      "text": "WHEREAS it is our duty to recognize the right of all older persons to spend their later years in whatever manner and in whatever surroundings shall best preserve their dignity and self-esteem, to be provided with opportunities to remain active and productive as long as they are able, and to be assured adequate care when they are ill or incapacitated.",
